#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_precompiledPreambleStorage)
#: shell/settings/languagepreferences.ui:421
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Store precompiled preambles in:"
msgstr "Pohrani unaprijed prevedene preambule u:"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, kcfg_precompiledPreambleStorage)
#: shell/settings/languagepreferences.ui:436
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Precompiled preambles remain in the temporary directory after KDevelop "
"crashes and are deleted only when the same session is started again.<br>\n"
"When the preambles are stored in memory, they are guaranteed to disappear on "
"exit even if KDevelop crashes.<br>\n"
"Choosing the Session Temporary Directory storage makes sense on systems "
"where RAM is limited and the temporary directory does not use tmpfs, because "
"the preamble files can occupy gigabytes of space.<br>\n"
"Changing this option takes effect after restarting KDevelop.<br>\n"
"This option has effect only if KDevelop has been built against Clang version "
"17 or later.\n"
"</p>"
msgstr "<p>Unaprijed prevedene preambule ostaju u privremenoj mapi nakon rušenja KDevelopa i brišu se tek pri sljedećem pokretanju iste sesije.<br>\nAko se preambule pohranjuju u memoriji, sigurno će nestati pri izlasku, čak i ako se KDevelop sruši.<br>\nPohrana u privremenu mapu sesije prikladna je na sustavima s malo RAM-a i privremenom mapom koja ne koristi tmpfs jer datoteke preambula mogu zauzeti gigabajte prostora.<br>\nPromjena ove mogućnosti stupa na snagu nakon ponovnog pokretanja KDevelopa.<br>\nOva mogućnost djeluje samo ako je KDevelop izgrađen s Clangom verzije 17 ili novije.\n</p>"

